				<div id="home-area-3side" class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 wc-100 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_1 et_pb_image_sticky">
				
				
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="477" height="248" src="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/01-1.png" alt="" title="01" srcset="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/01-1.png 477w, https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/01-1-300x156.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 477px) 100vw, 477px" class="wp-image-5250" /></span>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_2 selo-experiencia">
				
				
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="101" height="121" src="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/selo.png" alt="" title="selo" class="wp-image-263" /></span>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_4  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3 et_pb_image_sticky">
				
				
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="478" height="258" src="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/02-1.png" alt="" title="02" srcset="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/02-1.png 478w, https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/02-1-300x162.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 478px) 100vw, 478px" class="wp-image-5251" /></span>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_4">
				
				
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="477" height="248" src="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/03-1.png" alt="" title="03" srcset="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/03-1.png 477w, https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/03-1-300x156.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 477px) 100vw, 477px" class="wp-image-5252" /></span>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" >
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_3">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_heading et_pb_heading_3 et_pb_bg_layout_">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_heading_container"><h1 class="et_pb_module_heading">Venha viver essa experiência</h1></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p><span data-accessibility-base-font-size="18" data-accessibility-font-applied="1" style="font-size: 18px !important;">O Sesc Pantanal oferece experiências de ecoturismo transformadoras em dois biomas: <strong data-accessibility-base-font-size="18" data-accessibility-font-applied="1" style="font-size: 18px !important;">Pantanal</strong> e <strong data-accessibility-base-font-size="18" data-accessibility-font-applied="1" style="font-size: 18px !important;">Cerrado</strong>. Entre paisagens que mudam nos períodos de cheia e seca, cada visitante pode conhecer de perto o trabalho de <strong data-accessibility-base-font-size="18" data-accessibility-font-applied="1" style="font-size: 18px !important;">conservação</strong>, descobrir <strong data-accessibility-base-font-size="18" data-accessibility-font-applied="1" style="font-size: 18px !important;">saberes tradicionais</strong> e entender como a pesquisa contribui para <strong data-accessibility-base-font-size="18" data-accessibility-font-applied="1" style="font-size: 18px !important;">proteger a vida</strong>. Mais do que conhecer as unidades, é sentir, aprender e se conectar com um território cheio de vida, onde cada experiência fortalece o cuidado com o presente e o futuro.</span></p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_1_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module ">
				<a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_1 et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/viva-sua-experiencia/">Viva essa experiência</a>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 auto-contraste-none et_pb_fullwidth_section et_section_regular" >
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_fullwidth_image et_pb_fullwidth_image_0">
				
				
				
				
				<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="39" src="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/borda-superior-unidades-1.png" alt="" title="borda-superior-unidades-1" srcset="https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/borda-superior-unidades-1.png 1440w, https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/borda-superior-unidades-1-1280x35.png 1280w, https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/borda-superior-unidades-1-980x27.png 980w, https://www.sesc.com.br/sescpantanal/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/borda-superior-unidades-1-480x13.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) and (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (min-width: 1281px) 1440px, 100vw" class="wp-image-340" />
			
			</div>
				
				
